cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "fdo-squirrel-spec: Metadata Format for FDO Squirrel"
abstract: >-
  Generated specification of MD.cff, the metadata format read by
  fdo-squirrel to build FAIR Digital Objects: ZIP package structure, the
  MD.cff JSON Schema, the crosswalk to RDF, the file classification rules,
  and two real, harvested worked examples from fdo-squirrel-registry. Content
  is derived at build time from those repositories rather than duplicated by
  hand.
type: software
authors:
